Thanks to all whom responded, there are way too many to post. Several 
good suggestions which i'll note here. 

mount -r /dev/rzxc /cdrom UFS CD
mount -r -t cdfs /dev/rzxc /cdrom iso9660 cdfs CD
mount -r -t cdfs -o noversion /dev/rzxc /cdrom iso9660/cdfs CD w/o versions
