Having just upgraded to 4.0b let me share some information with you.

4.0b can only upgrade from 4.0 or 4.0a.
4.0 can only upgrade from 3.2c to 3.2f
4.0a can only upgade 3.2g or 4.0

There are some other constraints on lower versions too, but I'm not going
to list them here.

To go from 3.2c to 4.0b you have to at least go to 4.0 in the middle.

As I was winding my way through this mess I hit a few more levels than
