> the disk is tricky but wrote a utility to do this.  You can get it at
> ftp://ftp.eece.maine.edu/pub/src/alpha/util/ZIP_disklabel_1.0.tar.gz.  I
> even have an emergency bootable zip disk (single user mode though).  I
> also do not recomend a Jaz drive -- I'd spend the $500 on 3 Zip's with
> piles of disks if I had to do it over.
> 
> Andy.
> -- 
> Andy Sheaff - sheaff@eece.maine.edu
> http://www.eece.maine.edu/Faculty/Sheaff.html


and 

> We have a ZIP drive as you describe connected to our AlphaStation 400 and it is 
